/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 74 0 R
/T (Right now, local Indian businesses are stuck in a costly loop [3, 7]. To talk to or find customers who live in their very own cities, they have to pay a continuous "ad rent" to foreign servers [3]. This constant spending eats directly into the profit margins of our startups and small shops, leaving them with less money to grow or hire local workers [1, 7].)
