/E (For local Indian businesses, early-stage startups, and legacy neighborhood shops, the digital gatekeeper architecture operates as a strict structural filter. Merchants are systematically stripped of organic discoverability, forcing them to treat basic local visibility as a permanent, high-cost operational expense rather than an earned asset. Because public discovery tools function as private tollways, businesses must lock up significant daily liquidity in volatile keyword auctions just to prevent competitors from hijacking their own brand queries [4, 10].)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
