>>
endobj
226 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (Ultimately, shifting to a democratic architecture lowers the barriers to entry for early-stage digital native brands [7]. Without the threat of sudden, unannounced changes in search layout algorithms or mapping API pricing decided in Silicon Valley, businesses can focus capital directly on physical expansion and job creation [14]. Shifting the foundational infrastructure of commerce into an open public protocol ensures long-term operational resilience for the entire domestic software ecosystem [4].)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
